@startuml 領養申請提交流程
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title 領養申請提交流程 (Adoption Application Submission)

actor "申請人\n(Applicant)" as Applicant
participant "applications.py\n(Blueprint)" as ApplicationsBlueprint
participant "Application\n(Model)" as ApplicationModel
participant "Animal\n(Model)" as AnimalModel
participant "User\n(Model)" as UserModel
participant "notification_service.py\n(Service)" as NotificationService
participant "Notification\n(Model)" as NotificationModel
participant "email_tasks.py\n(Celery Task)" as EmailTask
participant "audit_service.py\n(Service)" as AuditService
participant "AuditLog\n(Model)" as AuditLogModel
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "Redis\n(Message Queue)" as Redis

== 1. 提交領養申請 ==

Applicant -> ApplicationsBlueprint: POST /api/applications\n{animal_id, contact_phone, contact_address,\noccupation, housing_type, has_experience, reason}
activate ApplicationsBlueprint

ApplicationsBlueprint -> ApplicationsBlueprint: @jwt_required()\n驗證 JWT Token
ApplicationsBlueprint -> UserModel: 查詢當前用戶 (get_jwt_identity)
activate UserModel
UserModel --> ApplicationsBlueprint: current_user
deactivate UserModel

ApplicationsBlueprint -> ApplicationsBlueprint: 權限檢查\n(user.role == GENERAL_MEMBER)
note right
  只有一般會員可以提出領養申請
  管理員與收容所帳號不可申請
end note

alt 不是一般會員
  ApplicationsBlueprint --> Applicant: 403 Forbidden\n"只有一般會員可提出領養申請"
end

ApplicationsBlueprint -> DB: 查詢 Animal (animal_id)
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationsBlueprint: animal
deactivate DB

ApplicationsBlueprint -> ApplicationsBlueprint: 業務邏輯檢查
note right
  1. 動物狀態必須是 PUBLISHED
  2. 動物未被領養 (status != ADOPTED)
  3. 申請人不是刊登者本人
  4. 沒有其他人的待審核申請
  5. 申請人未重複申請
end note

alt 動物已被領養
  ApplicationsBlueprint --> Applicant: 400 Bad Request\n"此動物已被領養"
else 動物狀態不是 PUBLISHED
  ApplicationsBlueprint --> Applicant: 400 Bad Request\n"此動物目前無法申請領養"
else 申請人是刊登者本人
  ApplicationsBlueprint --> Applicant: 400 Bad Request\n"您不能申請自己刊登的動物"
end

ApplicationsBlueprint -> DB: 檢查是否有進行中的申請\n(任何用戶)
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationsBlueprint: any_pending
deactivate DB

alt 有待審核申請
  ApplicationsBlueprint --> Applicant: 409 Conflict\n"此動物目前有待審核的申請"
end

ApplicationsBlueprint -> DB: 檢查當前用戶重複申請
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationsBlueprint: existing
deactivate DB

alt 已有申請
  ApplicationsBlueprint --> Applicant: 409 Conflict\n"您已對此動物提交申請"
end

ApplicationsBlueprint -> ApplicationsBlueprint: 檢查冪等性 Key\n(Idempotency-Key header)
note right
  支援冪等性，避免重複提交
  如果找到相同 idempotency_key 的申請
  直接返回該申請，不創建新申請
end note

ApplicationsBlueprint -> ApplicationModel: 建立 Application 物件\nstatus=PENDING, type=ADOPTION\napplicant_id=current_user_id
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel --> ApplicationsBlueprint: application
deactivate ApplicationModel

ApplicationsBlueprint -> DB: db.session.add(application)\ndb.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationsBlueprint: 成功
deactivate DB

ApplicationsBlueprint --> Applicant: 201 Created\n{application_id, status: "PENDING", ...}

== 2. 發送通知給動物擁有者 ==

ApplicationsBlueprint -> NotificationService: notify_application_submitted(\napplication, applicant_name, animal_name)
activate NotificationService

NotificationService -> DB: 查詢動物擁有者 (animal.owner_id)
activate DB
DB --> NotificationService: owner / shelter
deactivate DB

NotificationService -> NotificationService: 確定接收者 recipient_id
note right
  - 個人送養: owner_id
  - 收容所動物: shelter.primary_account_user_id
end note

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: 建立 Notification\ntype="application_submitted"\npayload={application_id, animal_name, ...}
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel --> NotificationService: notification
deactivate NotificationModel

NotificationService -> DB: db.session.add(notification)\ndb.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> NotificationService: 成功
deactivate DB

NotificationService --> ApplicationsBlueprint: notification
deactivate NotificationService

deactivate ApplicationsBlueprint

== 3. 送養人審核申請 ==

actor "送養人\n(Rehome Owner)" as Owner

Owner -> ApplicationsBlueprint: POST /api/applications/{application_id}/review\n{action: "approve" | "reject", review_notes}
activate ApplicationsBlueprint

ApplicationsBlueprint -> ApplicationsBlueprint: @jwt_required()\n驗證 JWT Token
ApplicationsBlueprint -> DB: 查詢 Application
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationsBlueprint: application
deactivate DB

ApplicationsBlueprint -> DB: 查詢 Animal
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationsBlueprint: animal
deactivate DB

ApplicationsBlueprint -> ApplicationsBlueprint: 權限檢查
note right
  審核權限:
  1. 個人送養: animal.owner_id == current_user_id
  2. 收容所動物: user.role == SHELTER_MEMBER 
     且 user.primary_shelter_id == animal.shelter_id
  3. 管理員無權審核領養申請
end note

alt 無權限審核
  ApplicationsBlueprint --> Owner: 403 Forbidden\n"只有送養人或收容所成員可以審核"
end

ApplicationsBlueprint -> ApplicationsBlueprint: 狀態檢查\n(status == PENDING or UNDER_REVIEW)
ApplicationsBlueprint -> ApplicationsBlueprint: 樂觀鎖檢查 (version)

alt action == "approve"
  ApplicationsBlueprint -> ApplicationModel: application.status = APPROVED\napplication.reviewed_at = now()\napplication.version += 1
  activate ApplicationModel
  ApplicationModel --> ApplicationsBlueprint: 更新成功
  deactivate ApplicationModel
  
  ApplicationsBlueprint -> AnimalModel: animal.status = ADOPTED\nanimal.updated_at = now()
  activate AnimalModel
  AnimalModel --> ApplicationsBlueprint: 動物標記為已領養
  deactivate AnimalModel
else action == "reject"
  ApplicationsBlueprint -> ApplicationModel: application.status = REJECTED\napplication.reviewed_at = now()\napplication.version += 1
  activate ApplicationModel
  ApplicationModel --> ApplicationsBlueprint: 更新成功
  deactivate ApplicationModel
end

ApplicationsBlueprint -> DB: db.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationsBlueprint: 成功
deactivate DB

== 4. 記錄審計日誌 (Async) ==

ApplicationsBlueprint -> AuditService: log_application_review(\napplication_id, reviewer_id, old_status, new_status)
activate AuditService

AuditService -> AuditLogModel: 建立 AuditLog\naction="application.review"\nactor_id=reviewer_id\ntarget_type="application"
activate AuditLogModel
AuditLogModel --> AuditService: audit_log
deactivate AuditLogModel

AuditService -> DB: db.session.add(audit_log)\ndb.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> AuditService: 成功
deactivate DB

AuditService --> ApplicationsBlueprint: 審計日誌已記錄
deactivate AuditService

== 5. 發送通知給申請人 (Async) ==

ApplicationsBlueprint -> NotificationService: notify_application_reviewed(\napplication, reviewer_id, status, review_notes)
activate NotificationService

NotificationService -> NotificationService: 決定通知類型
note right
  - APPROVED: "application_approved"
  - REJECTED: "application_rejected"
end note

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: 建立 Notification\nrecipient_id=applicant_id\ntype=notification_type
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel --> NotificationService: notification
deactivate NotificationModel

NotificationService -> DB: db.session.add(notification)\ndb.session.commit()
activate DB
DB --> NotificationService: 成功
deactivate DB

NotificationService --> ApplicationsBlueprint: 通知已建立
deactivate NotificationService

== 6. 發送 Email 通知 (Background Task) ==

ApplicationsBlueprint -> EmailTask: send_application_notification_email_task.delay(\nrecipient_email, animal_name, status, review_notes, contact_info)
activate EmailTask

EmailTask -> Redis: 將任務加入隊列
activate Redis
Redis --> EmailTask: 任務已排程
deactivate Redis

EmailTask --> ApplicationsBlueprint: 任務 ID
deactivate EmailTask

ApplicationsBlueprint --> Owner: 200 OK\n{message: "申請已核准/拒絕", application}

deactivate ApplicationsBlueprint

== 7. Celery Worker 處理 Email 任務 ==

Redis -> EmailTask: 取得待處理任務
activate EmailTask

EmailTask -> EmailTask: send_application_notification_email_task(\nrecipient_email, animal_name, status, ...)

EmailTask -> EmailTask: 準備 Email 內容
note right
  根據 status 選擇模板:
  - approved: 包含送養人聯絡資訊
  - rejected: 包含拒絕原因
  - under_review: 審核中通知
  
  使用 Jinja2 模板渲染
end note

EmailTask -> EmailTask: email_service.send_email(\nto, subject, template, context)

alt Email 發送成功
  EmailTask --> Redis: 任務完成 (success)
else Email 發送失敗
  EmailTask -> EmailTask: 重試機制 (最多3次)\n指數退避: 60s, 120s, 240s
  EmailTask --> Redis: 任務重試或失敗
end

deactivate EmailTask

note over Applicant, Redis
  **架構特點 (Decouple Principles)**:
  1. 服務層解耦: notification_service, audit_service 獨立處理業務邏輯
  2. 異步任務: Celery + Redis 處理耗時的 Email 發送
  3. 冪等性設計: Idempotency-Key 防止重複提交
  4. 樂觀鎖: version 欄位防止併發衝突
  5. 通知系統分離: 站內通知 (Notification) + Email 通知 (Celery Task)
  6. 審計追蹤: audit_service 統一記錄重要操作
  7. 重試機制: Celery 任務支援自動重試與指數退避
end note

@enduml